# Overview

Rules for code and build.

## Frontend

- Use `pnpm` to run frontend build
- Make components in src/components instead of in each file, especially the ones that make sense to be reused
- Each component has its own folder and associated scss module styles 

## Backend

- Avoid writing code in mod/lib files, make separate modules for related code.

## Tests

Update e2e tests if necessary. 
Do not run them everytime since they take a couple of minutes, suggest to run if impacting changes.
